<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL-E MAY NET FALLS TO PLN 1.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL-E MAY NET FALLS TO PLN 1.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results May </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MAY			1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.34 vs   2.20</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.34 vs   2.20</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.74 vs   0.05</p>
<p> Sales		    8.34 vs   3.97</p>
<p> JANUARY-MAY	    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	    28.77 vs   9.38</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	28.77 vs   9.38</p>
